---
title: Paper Plane
servings: 1
tags: [cocktail, whiskey]
source: Classic cocktail, number 32 on Drinks International's 2026 bestselling classics; method written for this repository
---

In a #cocktail shaker{}(with ice), pour equal parts @bourbon{0.75%fl_oz}, @Aperol{0.75%fl_oz}, @Amaro Nonino{0.75%fl_oz} and @lemon juice{0.75%fl_oz}. Shake briskly for ~{10%seconds}, and strain into a #coupe glass{}(well chilled).

> Created by Sam Ross in 2008.
